                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's Painkiller! \nI missed this one!\nIt's certainly better than the new one they released, then again all the games previous to that were better. \nIf you are a fan get it, although the menu goes to 1FPS on Windows 10,11. I tried a few fixes. It's still playable in 4K though.\nIt's just the usual balls to the wall action and mayhem that the originals released.\nGreat music as ever!",
